<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada sets second round of specials.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada sets second round of specials.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada on Thursday conducted a second round of special purchase and resale agreements in the money market at 3.50 percent, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the central bank intervened as the call loan or overnight lending rate continued to trade at the top of the bank's 3.0-3.50 percent target range.</p>
</text>
